        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Sivir hurls her crossblade like a boomerang, dealing damage each way.",
        "bodyHtml": "Sivir hurls her crossblade like a boomerang, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/85/110/135/160 + ([[si:scalead]]70% bonus Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power))</span> to all enemies it cuts through. Hitting non-champions reduces the damage to subsequent targets, down to a minimum of 40%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The damage falloff resets upon beginning its return.<br />Damage scales with Critical Strike Chance and Critical Strike Damage at 40% effectiveness.<br />Cast time scales down with Attack Speed</span>",
