        "name": "Ricochet",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Sivir's next few basic attacks gain additional attack speed and bounce to nearby targets, dealing reduced damage while bouncing.",
        "bodyHtml": "For the next 4 seconds, Sivir gains <span>20/25/30/35/40% Attack Speed</span> and her auto attacks are empowered to bounce to additional surrounding enemies dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">([[si:scalead]]40/42.5/45/47.5/50% Attack Damage) physical damage</span> each bounce for up to 8 bounces.<br /><br />These bounces critically strike if the attack generating them does.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Bounces will prioritize new targets before returning to targets that have already been struck. Can only hit each target a maximum of two times.<br />Bounces deal 65% damage to minions.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This ability executes low Health minions.</span>",
